    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1013">

                <pb facs="1043" n="923" sameAs="frus:frus1931v02/pg923"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">823.001 Sanchez Cerro, Luis/54: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Peru</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Dearing</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Lima</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-12-08T15:00:00-05:00">December 8, 1931—3
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 4:36 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>381. Referring to my telegram No. 378, December 6, 10 a.m.,<anchor n="29"
                        xml:id="d1013-f1"/> inauguration of Sanchez Cerro took place today about 1
                    o’clock in the Chamber of Deputies without untoward incident.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dearing</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
